# The +X/+0 of the {6} ability is fixed when the ability resolves (CR 608.2h: information about the game is used once, as
# the effect is applied, and the continuous effect is a fixed number, CR 611.2c): five artifacts, so Aerid Konstrari is
# 10/4. In the second main phase Bot2 destroys a Mox Emerald with Disenchant, leaving Bot1 four artifacts, and Aerid Konstrari is
# still 10/4. The Mox is really gone, so a recount would have given 9.

